1
00:00:00,540 --> 00:00:04,880
No way! Am I awake? Is this real life right now?

2
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:07,560
And, um, this is one of my favorites, too.

3
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,860
This is ridiculously huge!

4
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:14,180
You look like a literal angel! Like an angel!

5
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:17,520
Oh my god, Shinju! Did you take all of this?

6
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:19,120
Yeah, I did.

7
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:23,340
You're so talented! You've got such a great eye! I mean it! Like, wow!

8
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,240
What a nice thing to say. Thank you.

9
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:28,100
All I wanted was for her to take photos for me.

10
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:31,560
Then she decided to create an account and give me a cosplay name.

11
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:32,480
Really?

12
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:34,580
What made you do that?

13
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:37,300
Well, uh...

14
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:40,080
She just... she never wanted to show anyone her photos.

15
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:45,180
And I was so proud of how adorable she looked and wanted other people to see her like I did.

16
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:49,180
So I asked her if I could make an account to post them and she said yes.

17
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:52,520
She got so many likes and comments, it was amazing!

18
00:00:53,140 --> 00:00:56,460
People were posting tons of nice things about her on all the photos.

19
00:00:56,460 --> 00:01:03,020
The problem is that it got to be so overwhelming, I had no idea how I was supposed to respond.

20
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:05,900
So I just ended up ignoring all of them.

21
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:08,580
That's why no one ever got a response from her!

22
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:09,240
Mm-hmm.

23
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:11,820
I'm not cosplaying for their approval.

24
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:14,680
I do it for me, I don't care what they think.

25
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,020
Yeah, I know that.

26
00:01:16,220 --> 00:01:18,100
But look at the amount of followers you have now.

27
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:20,560
Isn't it amazing that people love what you love?

28
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:23,120
I know how happy it makes me to see it.

29
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:24,700
That's so sweet!

30
00:01:25,340 --> 00:01:25,980
What is?

31
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:27,400
How much you love your sister.

32
00:01:27,740 --> 00:01:29,000
I'm glad you have each other.

33
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:32,160
Yes, I love her so much!

34
00:01:34,460 --> 00:01:35,220
Oh?

35
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:38,720
And I can tell you feel the same way, Juju.

36
00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:41,100
Ew, don't tell me how I feel.

37
00:01:41,100 --> 00:02:11,080
I know how I feel.

38
00:02:11,100 --> 00:02:41,080
I know how I feel.

39
00:02:41,100 --> 00:03:11,080
I know how I feel.

40
00:03:11,100 --> 00:03:16,620
This is what we use.

41
00:03:16,980 --> 00:03:18,120
Our dad's DSLR.

42
00:03:19,220 --> 00:03:19,700
Nice!

43
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:22,680
Is your dad a professional photographer or something?

44
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:23,760
Not at all.

45
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:25,060
He just does it for fun.

46
00:03:25,460 --> 00:03:26,440
So fancy!

47
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:31,000
I love this camera because you don't have to change the lens for effects or different lighting.

48
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,020
That's interesting.

49
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:33,720
But when would you switch out the lens?

50
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:35,960
It really depends on what you're going for.

51
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,620
It's fun to experiment!

52
00:03:38,020 --> 00:03:40,880
Each lens makes it look totally different even when it's the same shot.

53
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:42,080
Question?

54
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:42,880
Yes?

55
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:43,800
What is it?

56
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:47,640
Is it that much better to use a camera than it is to use a smartphone?

57
00:03:47,640 --> 00:03:48,640
Yes.

58
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:52,920
The camera gives you a higher resolution and there's so much more you can do.

59
00:03:52,920 --> 00:04:00,180
For example, if you take a photo with flowers in the background, you can blur those flowers a bit to make the cosplayers stand out more.

60
00:04:01,020 --> 00:04:04,620
Or you can blur the foreground and give the photo a softer vibe overall.

61
00:04:05,340 --> 00:04:09,840
If petals or leaves are falling, you can adjust the shutter speed to keep them from looking blurry.

62
00:04:10,260 --> 00:04:11,360
Wow, that's amazing.

63
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:12,700
Yeah, for real.

64
00:04:12,860 --> 00:04:13,940
It sounds so fun.

65
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:14,540
It is.

66
00:04:14,540 --> 00:04:20,300
I love getting a picture to turn out exactly how I want, or capturing a unique expression out of the blue.

67
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:22,560
It inspires me.

68
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:25,900
I always want to learn more so I can take even better photos.

69
00:04:26,220 --> 00:04:27,940
Plus, you're taking pics of Juju!

70
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:30,280
She's like the best model there is!

71
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:30,860
Yeah.

72
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:34,340
Just curious, why don't you ever do cosplay, Shinju?

73
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:37,520
I mean, you're pretty much around them all the time.

74
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:38,840
Don't you want to try it too?

75
00:04:39,220 --> 00:04:43,800
There's no way you can watch Juju do so many adorable ones and not want to get in on the fun!

76
00:04:44,540 --> 00:04:46,980
I don't know.

77
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,260
Tell the truth, do you want to?

78
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:53,640
No, no.

79
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:55,040
I don't want to do it.

80
00:04:55,580 --> 00:04:57,280
I just love taking pictures for my sister.

81
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:59,400
I could never cosplay myself.

82
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:01,160
That's cool, I guess.

83
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,440
Thanks.

84
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:06,200
So, uh, can I try your camera for a sec?

85
00:05:06,460 --> 00:05:06,860
Sure.

86
00:05:07,820 --> 00:05:09,280
Whoa, this thing rocks!

87
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:12,880
I would love to learn how to take a shot with all the fuzzy background tricks!

88
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:15,100
I'm so saving up for one of these!

89
00:05:15,580 --> 00:05:17,060
You said it's a DSLR?

90
00:05:17,320 --> 00:05:18,840
How much do those typically cost?

91
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,060
Oh, here we go.

92
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:24,000
Huh?

93
00:05:25,140 --> 00:05:25,540
Huh?

94
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:26,640
Huh?

95
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:27,720
Huh?

96
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:30,740
Why would they sell the lens separately?

97
00:05:31,740 --> 00:05:33,000
Dude, you're so loud!

98
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:36,360
You can add a flash, a tripod, and the rest of it if you want to go broke.

99
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:36,920
Huh?

100
00:05:38,540 --> 00:05:42,300
You look funny when your mind's blown.

101
00:05:42,300 --> 00:05:47,600
But at the cosplay event, pretty much everyone had a camera like that.

102
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:49,320
How do people afford them?

103
00:05:49,420 --> 00:05:50,560
I know, it's crazy!

104
00:05:51,100 --> 00:05:54,800
It might take a while to save up, so let's keep taking pics with our phones for now.

105
00:05:55,260 --> 00:05:55,660
Okay.

106
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:58,100
Guess she's determined to get one regardless.

107
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,820
There are other cameras, you guys.

108
00:06:01,060 --> 00:06:02,780
I'm sure you can find one in your budget.

109
00:06:02,780 --> 00:06:08,620
Oh, by the way, we're gonna scout a location later if you want to come with us.

110
00:06:09,420 --> 00:06:13,860
This is the first time I'm renting a studio, so I want to know what options are out there.

111
00:06:13,980 --> 00:06:14,500
OMG!

112
00:06:14,820 --> 00:06:16,180
That sounds like so much fun!

113
00:06:16,700 --> 00:06:17,360
I'm in!

114
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:19,140
I would actually love to go too.

115
00:06:19,820 --> 00:06:20,120
Word.

116
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:22,780
Let's meet up at Shin Misato Station this weekend.

117
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:23,680
Okay!

118
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:28,520
Just as a warning, the space is in an abandoned hospital.

119
00:06:31,220 --> 00:06:31,980
Oh, wow.

120
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:33,620
I didn't know there were studios like this.

121
00:06:33,820 --> 00:06:34,380
I know, right?

122
00:06:34,500 --> 00:06:35,740
My first abandoned building.

123
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:36,760
Yeah, same!

124
00:06:37,660 --> 00:06:38,060
Cool.

125
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,160
I'm so excited.

126
00:06:39,880 --> 00:06:42,100
I couldn't even sleep last night because of it.

127
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:44,920
No freaking way!

128
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,880
It's like a horror flick in here!

129
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:48,940
Yeah, I was thinking the same thing.

130
00:06:48,940 --> 00:06:49,680
This is great.

131
00:06:50,220 --> 00:06:52,460
Especially since there is an abandoned hospital scene.

132
00:06:52,460 --> 00:06:55,220
Black Lily hides there after Princess Daisy defeats her.

133
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,380
Yeah, I know.

134
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:58,340
I mean, it's super depressing.

135
00:06:58,900 --> 00:07:02,020
But I really like the scene where Shion starts to question her own sanity.

136
00:07:02,860 --> 00:07:06,080
But what's most important is that you really did watch the whole thing.

137
00:07:06,340 --> 00:07:06,960
Hey, Gojo!

138
00:07:07,380 --> 00:07:08,380
We're going upstairs!

139
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:09,200
Don't get killed!

140
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:10,140
I'll try.

141
00:07:10,740 --> 00:07:11,140
You ready, Shinju?

142
00:07:11,140 --> 00:07:14,160
I guess this place is a little on the creepy side, isn't it?

143
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,860
You okay, Inui?

144
00:07:19,660 --> 00:07:21,180
Yeah, of course!

145
00:07:22,460 --> 00:07:24,720
You don't sound too sure about that.

146
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,960
Do places like this make you uncomfortable?

147
00:07:28,460 --> 00:07:28,900
What?

148
00:07:29,060 --> 00:07:30,420
Why would you even ask me that?

149
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:32,160
I shoot in dark locations all the time!

150
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:33,060
You're slowing us down!

151
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:33,560
Let's go!

152
00:07:33,740 --> 00:07:35,040
I'll take that as a yes.

153
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:36,720
I mean...

154
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:39,000
So what if it has murder vibes, am I right?

155
00:07:41,140 --> 00:07:43,640
I'm just worried it might be too dark to shoot.

156
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,320
Nah, we have a flash.

157
00:07:45,380 --> 00:07:45,920
It's fine.

158
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:47,380
You're such a superhero.

159
00:07:47,380 --> 00:07:49,640
Flashes and reflectors are the heroes.

160
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:51,760
They can be used in outdoor shoots as well.

161
00:07:51,960 --> 00:07:53,380
So they're important to have.

162
00:07:53,660 --> 00:07:54,460
Even if it's sunny?

163
00:07:55,100 --> 00:07:55,440
Yep.

164
00:07:55,440 --> 00:08:05,340
Natural light is awesome, but it's hard to keep your eyes open in the sun.

165
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:07,320
That's why we make it the backlighting.

166
00:08:07,580 --> 00:08:09,820
It creates a beautiful soft light on your skin.

167
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:13,400
Though, it also casts dark shadows all over your face.

168
00:08:13,540 --> 00:08:14,120
Oh, I know!

169
00:08:14,340 --> 00:08:16,520
Then you use reflectors to bring your face back!

170
00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:17,360
You got it!

171
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:21,380
It also makes the wigs nice and shiny, and improves your complexion, too!

172
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,460
That's so lit!

173
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,220
Like, literally.

174
00:08:23,380 --> 00:08:24,360
I gotta tell Gojo!

175
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:26,040
Backlighting is the best!

176
00:08:28,540 --> 00:08:30,200
It looks like it's gonna rain.

177
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,140
Yeah.

178
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:32,800
Man.

179
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:37,180
I'd love to do a shoot outside someday when the weather's not so blah.

180
00:08:37,900 --> 00:08:40,680
Come to think of it, where do you guys usually go to take outdoor photos?

181
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,500
Just our backyard.

182
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:48,500
It's really coming down.

183
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:55,600
Hey, what's going on?

184
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:58,720
Inui?

185
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:00,340
It's fine!

186
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:01,000
Everything's fine!

187
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:02,060
I'm just a little tired!

188
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:04,060
That's not even a little convincing.

189
00:09:04,820 --> 00:09:06,280
Would you rather wait by the entrance?

190
00:09:06,540 --> 00:09:07,180
Heck no!

191
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:11,280
I'm going to cosplay Black Lily no matter what.

192
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:17,440
I just have to get comfortable with the location, or I'll have an awkward expression in every photo.

193
00:09:19,340 --> 00:09:21,100
Want me to take a look around for you?

194
00:09:21,500 --> 00:09:23,080
Don't worry, you can go on back.

195
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:24,200
Seriously?

196
00:09:24,580 --> 00:09:26,100
I can handle this myself!

197
00:09:26,260 --> 00:09:26,960
Yeah, I know.

198
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,400
But it seems like a lot.

199
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:32,720
Is there a reason you're pushing so hard?

200
00:09:36,380 --> 00:09:37,300
My dreams.

201
00:09:37,300 --> 00:09:39,860
Don't you ever plan for the future?

202
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:41,320
Yes.

203
00:09:41,820 --> 00:09:43,240
I want to be a kashirashi.

204
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:46,680
It's a kind of artist that designs the faces of Hina dolls.

205
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:48,980
That's a lovely dream.

206
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:51,120
Good luck making it come true.

207
00:09:52,220 --> 00:09:53,140
I couldn't.

208
00:09:53,140 --> 00:10:00,140
I always wanted to become a magical girl.

209
00:10:02,140 --> 00:10:05,640
I admired their strength, optimism, and confidence.

210
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:08,680
Fighting battles in cute, frilly outfits.

211
00:10:09,420 --> 00:10:11,220
I've looked up to them since I was little.

212
00:10:11,500 --> 00:10:12,760
I was obsessed.

213
00:10:12,760 --> 00:10:16,640
I really thought I could become one when I got older.

214
00:10:18,140 --> 00:10:21,520
But once you start school, you learn the truth.

215
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,620
It's all make-believe.

216
00:10:24,140 --> 00:10:25,080
None of it's real.

217
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:29,400
I learned that no matter how hard I worked or prayed,

218
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:33,100
my dream of being a magical girl would never come true.

219
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:36,240
Then one day, when I was in middle school,

220
00:10:37,520 --> 00:10:42,400
I discovered that I could at least look like them for a while.

221
00:10:46,580 --> 00:10:50,460
I'd never cosplayed before, so I had no clue how to style the wig.

222
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:52,540
I didn't even put makeup on.

223
00:10:52,540 --> 00:10:55,440
And the outfit wasn't tailored, so it was way too big.

224
00:10:56,460 --> 00:11:01,540
To be honest, my first attempt at cosplay was a mess, but...

225
00:11:02,640 --> 00:11:04,560
I didn't care.

226
00:11:05,040 --> 00:11:06,800
Just wearing it made me so happy.

227
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:11,080
I found a way to make all my dreams come true.

228
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:14,700
Even if it's make-believe, the way I feel is real.

229
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:19,180
Can I ask you something?

230
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:20,200
Sure, what?

231
00:11:20,580 --> 00:11:22,500
This outfit is important to you.

232
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:24,680
So why'd you ask me to make it?

233
00:11:25,260 --> 00:11:27,700
There are so many people who are better at this than I am.

234
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:29,620
People with real experience.

235
00:11:30,180 --> 00:11:31,940
Why don't you pick one of them instead?

236
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:37,880
Honestly, it's because of the photos Maureen posted.

237
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:39,520
I was jealous.

238
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:45,020
I know how pathetic and lame that sounds, believe me.

239
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:46,380
But it's the truth.

240
00:11:46,900 --> 00:11:48,820
I couldn't stop obsessing over it.

241
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:56,200
I felt like the only way to calm my inner rage was to have an outfit made by the same person, no matter who they were.

242
00:11:56,200 --> 00:12:00,160
And you're right.

243
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:02,360
There are many others who can make the same outfit.

244
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:03,360
But still...

245
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:05,580
I'm sorry.

246
00:12:05,580 --> 00:12:08,080
I'm not explaining this very well.

247
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:09,820
It's not logical.

248
00:12:09,820 --> 00:12:13,160
Seeing that outfit was like...

249
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:15,320
Love at first sight.

250
00:12:15,780 --> 00:12:17,960
There's something about it I can't explain.

251
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:20,500
I know how this must sound to you.

252
00:12:20,640 --> 00:12:23,220
Honestly, I'm surprised my feelings are so strong.

253
00:12:23,540 --> 00:12:27,300
But I've heard that jealousy is something you only feel about things that truly matter.

254
00:12:27,300 --> 00:12:29,800
These are called Hina dolls.

255
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:30,980
Pretty, aren't they?

256
00:12:31,220 --> 00:12:33,140
I made them with some of my old pals.

257
00:12:33,540 --> 00:12:34,680
Do you like them?

258
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:36,140
Mm-hmm.

259
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:37,320
A lot.

260
00:12:37,980 --> 00:12:39,240
I love them.

261
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:44,040
They're so beautiful.

262
00:12:46,760 --> 00:12:49,500
The most beautiful in the world, I say.

263
00:12:50,340 --> 00:12:55,600
At this shop, we work hard every single day to make sure our dolls catch the eyes.

264
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:58,660
We want our customers to think they're the best ever made.

265
00:12:59,040 --> 00:13:00,640
Because they are to us.

266
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:02,960
So I'm glad that you like them.

267
